<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Shiv Lal v. The State (Govt. of NCT Delhi), BAIL APPLN. 3445/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Sachin Datta</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>3 November 2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>FIR</th><td>No. 226/2023, PS Crime Branch — Sections 489A/489B/489C/489D/120B/34 IPC (counterfeit currency)</td></tr>
